Training data:
- Courtois NeuroMod (CC0 open subset: sub-01, sub-02, sub-03, sub-05),
  released by McGill via the Canadian Open Neuroscience Platform (CONP).
  https://docs.cneuromod.ca/en/latest/ACCESS.html
- BOLD Moments Dataset (Lahner et al. 2024, OpenNeuro ds005165). Used
  through frozen feature encoders only; stimulus frames not redistributed.
  https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-024-50310-3
- Narratives (Nastase et al. 2021, OpenNeuro ds002345). fMRI labels and
  feature-extractor embeddings only; original stimulus audio is not
  redistributed with this model.
  https://www.nature.com/articles/s41597-021-01033-3

Architectural inspiration:
- TRIBE v1 (D'Ascoli et al. 2025, arXiv:2507.22229). This model uses
  the architecture family described in the published paper; it does not
  contain or derive from TRIBE v1 or TRIBE v2 weights.
